摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"All-in-one AI desktop app: one-click install for Claude Code, Codex CLI, DeepSeek and more, manage AI accounts and quotas, smart model routing with auto-failover, voice input, and run local LLMs. Bonus: a Token Pet that grows as you use AI.","id":"gh:1158472225","install_available":false,"language":"Rust","name":"EchoBird","slug":"edison7009/EchoBird","topics":["ai-assistants","ai-tools","all-in-one","chatgpt","claude-code","codex-cli","deepseek","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","kimi-code","openclaw","opencode","rust","zcode"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"All-in-one AI desktop app: one-click install for Claude Code, Codex CLI, DeepSeek and more, manage A"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"I accounts and quotas, smart model routing with auto-failover, voice input, and run local LLMs. Bonu"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"s: a Token Pet that grows as you use AI."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"EchoBird"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"All-in-one AI desktop app: one-click install for Claude Code, Codex CLI, DeepSeek and more, manage A"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"I accounts and quotas, smart model routing with auto-failover, voice input, and run local LLMs. Bonu"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"s: a Token Pet that grows as you use AI."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Website ·\nDownload ·\n☕ Buy a coffee ·\n中文 README"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Note** — This repository is just one of several download channels\n> and an issue tracker. For pr"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"oduct information, announcements, and\n> commercial inquiries, visit echobird.ai."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What is EchoBird?"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Friends kept asking me to install **Claude Code**, **OpenClaw**, **Hermes Agent**… every machine was"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" different, and some refused to pay for an LLM. Setup and explanations took forever. So I built **Ec"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"hoBird** — an Agent inspired by **Songbird**, the genius netrunner from _Cyberpunk 2077_ who solves "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"any tech problem for V…"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"中文"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"English"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"EchoBird offers **4 scenarios** sharing a **unified model data hub** — **configure once, used everyw"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"d offers **4 scenarios** sharing a **unified model data hub** — **configure once, used everywhere**."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 4 scenarios"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **Install & Repair Agent** — let an AI install and fix mainstream tools (Claude Code, OpenClaw, He"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"rmes Agent, …); works locally and remotely\n- **One-click local LLM** — bundled vLLM / SGLang / llama"},{"id":"p13s3","text":".cpp runtimes; pick a quant, hit START\n- **Plugin Hub (Developer Preview)** — install reviewed commu"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"nity plugins or add extensions from a repository or local directory\n- **App Manager** — one-click la"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"unch and management for every AI / Agent app & game"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Shared foundation"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **Model Nexus** — a unified data hub for OpenAI / Anthropic / local LLMs / API Routers; configure "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"once and all 4 scenarios pick it up; one-click latency check before you commit"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Cross-platform** — Windows, macOS, Linux (x64 + arm64)"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Multi-account switching — ChatGPT, Codex CLI, and Claude Code"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Manage multiple saved accounts in EchoBird's **App Manager**, view their usage quota, and choose the"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" account to use when launching a tool."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **ChatGPT desktop and Codex CLI** — add OpenAI accounts through browser sign-in, then select a sav"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ed account and launch. Both tools share the local Codex account configuration, so switching affects "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"the shared login.\n- **Claude Code** — add accounts through browser authorization, select an account,"},{"id":"p19s4","text":" and launch Claude Code with it. View the plan, remaining 5-hour and 7-day quota, and reset countdow"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"ns when available.\n- **Quota at a glance** — check remaining quota and reset times, refresh account "},{"id":"p19s6","text":"usage, and remove saved accounts from the same panel."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**Get started:** open App Manager → choose ChatGPT, Codex CLI, or Claude Code → add and authorize yo"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ur accounts → select an account → launch. Account selection takes effect on launch; choose a third-p"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"arty model instead when you want to use an API provider."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Multi-model smart routing — priority and automatic failover"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"EchoBird's **Smart Router** puts multiple model providers behind one local API. Add free, paid, or p"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"rivate models from Model Nexus, then drag the cards into your preferred order. The router tries mode"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ls in that order and automatically falls back when a model is rate-limited, out of quota, or tempora"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"rily unavailable. After cooldown, it retries models in priority order."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- **Up to 20 models** — reuse your configured models without entering their API keys again.\n- **One "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"endpoint for compatible tools** — supports OpenAI Chat Completions and Anthropic Messages, including"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" clients such as Claude Code.\n- **Explicit priority** — you control the order; routing follows that "},{"id":"p23s4","text":"order rather than selecting models by task or price."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"**Get started:** open Smart Router → add models from My Models or the free-model directory → drag to"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" set priority → choose **Auto Router** for a compatible tool in App Manager. Keep EchoBird running w"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"hile tools use its local API."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Smart Router switches between configured model APIs; it does not automatically rotate saved login ac"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"counts. ChatGPT / Codex CLI third-party models require the **Responses API**, which Smart Router doe"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"s not currently expose. For those tools, use account switching or a Responses-compatible provider di"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"urrently expose. For those tools, use account switching or a Responses-compatible provider directly."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Explore account switching and smart routing on the website."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Supported tools — install & switch models in one click"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"EchoBird bundles the install references and **writes each tool's native config\nfile**, so you instal"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"l from one place and — crucially — **switch the model\nwith a single click**. Configure a provider on"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ce in Model Nexus, then point\nany supported tool at it; no manual TOML / JSON editing, no per-CLI re"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"-login.\nThis is the part most \"model switcher\" repos leave you to figure out alone."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### One-click install + one-click model switch"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The tools below support **both** — install _and_ model switching — which is\nthe core of what EchoBir"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" below support **both** — install _and_ model switching — which is\nthe core of what EchoBird is for:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"**Coding CLIs** — Claude Code · Codex CLI (OpenAI) · Grok Build (xAI) ·\nKimi CLI (Moonshot) · Qwen C"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"ode · Aider · OpenCode · MiMo Code (Xiaomi) · Kilo Code ·\nZCode (Z.AI) · OpenClaw · Pi · Vibe-Tradin"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"de · Aider · OpenCode · MiMo Code (Xiaomi) · Kilo Code ·\nZCode (Z.AI) · OpenClaw · Pi · Vibe-Trading"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"**Desktop apps** — Claude Desktop (3P profile) · ChatGPT desktop ·\nKimi Desktop · OpenCode Desktop ·"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" OpenScience · WorkBuddy (Tencent CodeBuddy)"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"> Searching GitHub for \"switch model for Grok Build\" or \"switch model for\n> Kimi CLI or Kimi Desktop"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"\"? Those are first-class here — pick the model in Model Nexus,\n> hit switch, and EchoBird rewrites `"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"~/.grok/config.toml` or\n> `~/.kimi-code/config.toml` for you."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"### One-click install & launch"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"These are detected, installed, and managed by EchoBird, but model switching\nis handled by the app it"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"self (vendor-locked or no model config):"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Hermes Desktop · Claude Science · Cursor · VS Code ·\nGemini Desktop · Coffee CLI"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
